+FILE/COMMENT
 Products available from:
   https://navigation-office.esa.int
 The following signals are considered equal 
  - GPS P     equal to W for L1, L2         
        S/L/X equal to L for L1, L2         
        I/Q/X equal to Q for L5             
  - GLO I/Q/X equal to Q for L3             
  - GAL B/C/X equal to C for L1, L6         
        I/Q/X equal to Q for L5, L7, L8     
  - BEI D/P/X equal to P for L1, L5, L8     
        D/P/Z equal to D for L7             
  - QZS S/L/X equal to L for L1, L2, L6     
        I/Q/X equal to Q for L5             
        D/P/Z equal to P for L5s            
        D/P/X equal to X for L8             
